TITLE=E2E-59: Engagement — Tier 1 rollup (engagement metrics, stage 2)
BODY=On an installation with disposition + PR-lifecycle history, trigger the hourly rollup and inspect the engagement block (acceptance rate, command usage, approx finding-action rate, re-review rate, reviewedPrCount, activeInstallation) — null rates for empty denominators, identical on both backends. No fixture PR.
